    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\tDO CheckObjectWeight\n\t\tDO CheckObjectVolume\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
